* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.icns binary
# Archives of the kit (a release, or Code > Download ZIP) write their commit into tools/commit (./kit update reads it).
tools/commit export-subst
# Releases and Download ZIP carry the kit and nothing else: no tests, docs, website, Mac app or developer tools, except
# the two files of site/ the kit reads (kit.json's last version, for ./kit update's merge, and the builder's sizes, for
# estimate).
/tests export-ignore
/docs export-ignore
/mac export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/AGENTS.md export-ignore
/CLAUDE.md export-ignore
/site/** export-ignore
/site/kit.json -export-ignore
/site/sources.json -export-ignore
/package.json export-ignore
/package-lock.json export-ignore
/eslint.config.mjs export-ignore
